OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FMore than 25 fire engines have been
OL,8,Ftackling a blaze near the A31 in
OL,9,FHampshire after a vehicle fire spread
OL,10,Fto nearby heathland, the fire service
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FThe Hampshire and Isle of Wight Fire
OL,14,Fand Rescue Service said they received
OL,15,Fmore than 160 emergency calls
OL,16,Freporting a vehicle on fire on the
OL,17,Feastbound A31 at about 5.24pm on
OL,18,FSunday.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
