OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FTwenty-six fire engines, four water
OL,8,Fcarriers, six off-road vehicles and
OL,9,Fseveral command vehicles were at the
OL,10,Fsite near Ringwood and would remain
OL,11,Fovernight, the fire service said.
OL,13,FThe fire service said: "The fire
OL,14,Fspread from the vehicle to the central
OL,15,Freservation before progressing into
OL,16,Fnearby heathland.
OL,18,F"Crews from across Hampshire,
OL,19,Fsupported by colleagues from Dorset
OL,20,Fand Wiltshire Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,21,Fare currently attending the incident."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FThe A31 is closed between Picket Post
OL,8,Fand junction two of the M27.
OL,10,FMotorists have been urged to avoid the
OL,11,Farea and use alternative routes
OL,12,Fwhenever possible.
OL,14,FThe fire service added: "Please follow
OL,15,Fdiversion signs, allow extra time for
OL,16,Fyour journey and avoid the area to
OL,17,Fallow emergency crews to work safely."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
