OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FHampshire crews are fighting another
OL,8,F"significant fire" about 24 miles from
OL,9,FRingwood in Holbury, where bungalows
OL,10,Fand vehicles on Rollestone Road caught
OL,11,Ffire after flames spread from a
OL,12,Fhedgerow.
OL,14,FThe fire service said in an update at
OL,15,F9.15pm on Sunday: "The fire initially
OL,16,Finvolved a hedgerow at a property,
OL,17,Fbefore spreading to two vehicles in a
OL,18,Fdriveway and subsequently to two
OL,19,Fadjoining bungalows.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,F"Crews are working to prevent any
OL,8,Ffurther spread of the fire and bring
OL,9,Fthe incident under control.
OL,11,F"Firefighters from Hightown,
OL,12,FPortchester, Totton, Gosport and
OL,13,FFareham are in attendance, supported
OL,14,Fby colleagues from Dorset and
OL,15,FWiltshire Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,17,F"Crews are using multiple hoses and
OL,18,Fjets, together with an aerial
OL,19,Fplatform, to tackle the fire."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FResidents have been urged to keep
OL,8,Fwindows and doors closed because of
OL,9,Fsmoke, and people have been asked to
OL,10,Favoid the area where possible and to
OL,11,Fkeep the road clear.
OL,13,FHot weather continued to build on
OL,14,FSunday, with the south and south-
OL,15,Feastern parts of England expected to
OL,16,Fhave the highest temperatures.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
