OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FAccording to the Fire Severity Index,
OL,8,Fany wildfires were likely to be
OL,9,Fexceptionally severe on Sunday in
OL,10,Falmost all of the east and south-east
OL,11,Fof England.
OL,13,F"Exceptional" severity is its highest
OL,14,Franking.
OL,16,FThe Met Office data includes rainfall,
OL,17,Ftemperature and humidity, and agencies
OL,18,Fuse the index to assess the severity
OL,19,Fof fire if it starts.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
