OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FIt does not cover the chances of
OL,8,Fwildfires occurring.
OL,10,FHeatwave conditions will likely return
OL,11,Fnext week, with a high of 36C expected
OL,12,Fin parts of East Anglia and south-east
OL,13,FEngland by Thursday, according to the
OL,14,FMet Office.
OL,16,FSo far the extreme weather of summer
OL,17,F2026 has included two record-breaking
OL,18,Fheatwaves in May and June that led to
OL,19,Fmore than 2,800 excess deaths.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
