PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786456114
OL,3,CMore than 25 fire engines tackle
OL,4,Cheathland blaze after A31 vehicle fire
OL,5,Cspreads
OL,7,FTwo more heatwaves in July, the driest
OL,8,FJuly in England and Wales since
OL,9,Frecords began in 1836, have fuelled
OL,10,Fdrought and wildfires.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/9
